$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Typical Procedure for the Synthesis of 4aa A
magnetic stirring bar, 1a (240.8 mg, 1.0 mmol), 2a (150.5 mg, 1.5 mmol),
3 (302.1 mg, 1.2 mmol), PdCl2 (9.0 mg, 0.05 mmol), LiCl (8.9 mg, 0.2
mmol), Et3N (151.0 mg, 1.5 mmol), and C6H6 (10 mL) were placed in Pyrex
vial under Ar. Then, t-BuNC (23 µL, 0.2 mmol) was added. The solution was
irradiated with Solarbox (Xe, 1000 W/m2) with violently stirring for 16
h. The reaction mixture filtered and concentrated in vacuo to give a
residue, which was subjected to silica gel column chromatography using
hexane/EtOAc = 50/1 as eluent, 4aa (131.0 mg, 0.71 mmol, 71%). ethyl
3-cyclohexylpropanoate (4aa)2 ethyl
2-(4-ethoxy-4-oxobutyl)cyclopentane-1-carboxylate (4ha)2 Colorless oil
(102.6 mg, 0.40 mmol, 40%). Obtained as a cis/trans mixture in a 66/34
ratio. Cis isomer: 1H-NMR (CDCl3, 400 MHz) δ 4.13-4.06 (m, 4H), 2.84-2.80
(m, 1H), 2.29-2.25 (m, 2H), 2.15-2.00 (m, 1H), 1.95-1.62 (m, 3H),
1.55-1.15 (m, 14H), 1.25 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 3H), 1.13-1.01 (m, 2H); 13C-NMR
(CDCl3, 100 MHz) δ 175.44, 173.62, 60.19, 47.51, 43.43, 34.46, 30.97,
30.61, 2.34, 24.01, 23.79, 14.22. Trans isomer: 1H-NMR (CDCl3, 400 MHz) δ
4.13-4.06 (m, 4H), 2.29-2.25 (m, 3H), 2.15-2.00 (m, 1H), 1.95-1.62 (m,
3H), 1.55-1.15 (m, 14H), 1.25 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 3H), 1.13-1.01 (m, 2H);
13C-NMR (CDCl3, 100 MHz) δ 176.59, 173.62, 59.86, 50.36, 44.01, 34.75,
34.60, 32.46, 30.31, 24.72, 23.63, 14.33.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM photochemical, regioselective, stereoselective, tin-free Giese reaction,
Solarbox used
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Hydroalkylation of alkenes using alkyl iodides and Hantzsch ester under
palladium/light system
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Sumino, Shuhei; Ryu, Ilhyong
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2016), 18(1), 52-55

